abstract: >-
  LOT is an explainable real-estate acquisition workspace that combines public parcel evidence,
  thesis-specific property scoring, underwriting context, owner research, financing scenarios,
  a decision pipeline, and a self-hosted web interface.
keywords:
  - real estate
  - property research
  - underwriting
  - investment analysis
  - public records
  - self-hosted
  - Next.js
  - PostgreSQL
